00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:29.180
Since it's been decided that at the bottom of a dungeon is either a Minotaur or a demon lord.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:34.160
Since I don't have a cow's head, I have to be the demon lord!

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:38.590
