00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:09.980
So it was not his will to attack me!

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:13.730
I will not forgive you for making me fight with Takuto!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.830
It looks like you've finally become serious.

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:20.190
Then you shall use all that anger against me!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.670
Falce, you were...

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.470
Stop it, Tanarotte!

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:32.290
No!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.880
Falce!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:43.260
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.730
You are... the Falce.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:10.080
Yes, Falcesque's last and greatest masterpiece.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:15.340
But Falcesque died without even giving it a name.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:19.970
Nobody knows the reason

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:22.750
why Falcesque made this staff.

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:25.630
And neither did that staff.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:30.200
What she, an unnamed staff, was, or why she was born...

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:34.980
She must have been thinking about that for the longest time...

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:39.040
The reason for her existence, she who was never given a role.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:42.950
But she found no answer, and tried to put an end to it.

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:47.560
By playing the role of a demon lord, that would certainly be defeated by the hero.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.460
That can't be...

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:54.960
Takuto, was I wrong?

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:55.790
Was I...?

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:58.200
No, you weren't.

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:00.620
No, this is how it should have been.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.090
But...

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:11.540
Since you were born in this world, you could have stayed the way you were.

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.280
<b>Addressed to:
Hasegawa Takuto-sama, Sakuma Eitarou</b>

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:22.640
Taku-chan, this is...?

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:23.040
Who knows? But…but the sender is sempai...
Taku-chan, this is...?

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.710
Who knows? But…but the sender is sempai...

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:28.450
I'm going to open it!

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.000
Here goes!

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.330
It's a Dutch Wife.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:39.200
T-T-This is....

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:41.170
Taku-chan... you pervert.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.090
I-It's a misunderstanding, Suzuho!

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:45.930
Tanarotte, you also shouldn't
remember words like that!

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:50.930
Oh good, we meet again.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:53.370
Oh, Falce?

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:54.290
Yes.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:59.620
I don't know how, but someone named Sakuma fixed me.

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:02.480
Uhh..well then, why are you here?

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:07.730
Oh? Wasn't it you who told me those gentle words?

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:11.240
I shall stay the way I am.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:17.080
So, I have chosen to stay beside you.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:20.340
Please take care of me, my dear master!

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:22.810
M-Master?

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:25.580
The newcomer seems to have a lot of courage.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.310
That's not fair!

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:33.140
I see. So you, sempai, can go ahead, and I will be number 3!

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.560
That sounds so WRONG!

00:21:35.930 --> 00:21:38.640
I'm the number one on technique. I'm going first!

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.820
But you're certainly the number two for power!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.200
I'm going before you!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.410
So then I will join!

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:48.030
The third one now, damn brat.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:54.490
Have a great night tonight!

