pasuteru ni hibiku melodi-

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:14.280
Mu-Mu-Music
myu myu music

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:17.770
Sun-Sun-Sunshine
sun sun sunshine

00:23:18.050 --> 00:23:21.120
Mu-Mu-Music
myu myu music

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:29.540
And that is how my days of devotion begin with my master

